the target language is: lps.

the knowledge base parties_iou_test extends parties.

the maximum time is 18.

the knowledge base parties_iou_test includes:

% Daml (the script run on a Canton sandbox) ends with these active contracts (their payloads;
% the ids are the ledger's):
%   - iou_sender(alice,bob)
%   - iou_sender(bob,charlie)
%   - non_transitive(alice,bob)
%   - non_transitive(alice,bob)
%   - iou(alice,bob,"USD",100.0)
%   - iou(alice,charlie,"USD",100.0)
%   - iou(alice,charlie,"USD",100.0)
% The twin's final state under LPS2 (`lps state`) is compared with it by test_daml.pl.
scenario iou_test is:
    % the Daml Script iou_test
    % Daml refuses the next command (submitMustFail): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    alice creates the iou c1 with issuer alice, owner bob, cash currency "USD" and cash amount 100.0 from 1 to 2.
    alice creates the iou iou with issuer alice, owner alice, cash currency "USD" and cash amount 100.0 from 2 to 3.
    % Daml refuses the next command (submitMustFail): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    alice exercises transfer on the iou iou with new owner bob creating c2 from 3 to 4.
    alice creates the iou proposal iou_proposal with iou issuer alice, iou owner bob, iou cash currency "USD" and iou cash amount 100.0 from 4 to 5.
    bob exercises accept on the iou proposal iou_proposal creating c3 from 5 to 6.
    alice creates the iou transfer proposal tpab with iou issuer alice, iou owner alice, iou cash currency "USD", iou cash amount 100.0 and new owner bob from 6 to 7.
    bob exercises accept on the iou transfer proposal tpab creating iou2 from 7 to 8.
    bob exercises propose transfer on the iou iou2 with new owner charlie creating tpbc from 8 to 9.
    charlie exercises accept on the iou transfer proposal tpbc creating c4 from 9 to 10.
    bob creates the iou sender sab with sender alice and receiver bob from 10 to 11.
    charlie creates the iou sender sbc with sender bob and receiver charlie from 11 to 12.
    alice exercises send iou on the iou sender sab with iou cid iou creating iou4 from 12 to 13.
    bob exercises send iou on the iou sender sbc with iou cid iou4 creating c5 from 13 to 14.
    alice creates the non transitive nt1 with party a alice and party b bob from 14 to 15.
    alice creates the non transitive nt2 with party a alice and party b bob from 15 to 16.
    % Daml refuses the next command (submitMustFail): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    bob exercises try b on the non transitive nt1 with other nt2 creating c6 from 16 to 17.

